survive, you know, Armageddon because they were so shellacked and gross.
世界末日了也能留存下来，因为它们被涂得又硬又恶心。

198
00:09:32.350 --> 00:09:33.250
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

199
00:09:33.330 --> 00:09:34.330
You couldn't eat them.
你根本没法吃它们。

200
00:09:35.190 --> 00:09:36.790
They were like sticks.
它们就像木棍一样。

201
00:09:37.110 --> 00:09:37.410
Yeah.
是啊。

202
