00:10:09.890 --> 00:10:10.430
managers.
经理们。

217
00:10:10.770 --> 00:10:13.530
We are hanging on his every word.
我们当时听得入神。

218
00:10:13.730 --> 00:10:14.410
We're laughing.
我们都在笑。

