00:27:19.330 --> 00:27:22.430
But on the show, our characters were meant to be the same age.
但在剧中，我们的角色设定是同龄人。

601
00:27:22.630 --> 00:27:23.670
I couldn't tell.
我没看出来。

602
00:27:23.870 --> 00:27:26.590
So I think they made Jim a little bit older than John.
所以我觉得他们把吉姆设定得比约翰稍微大一点。

603
00:27:26.590 --> 00:27:28.530
And they made Pam a little younger than me.
然后把帕姆设定得比我稍微年轻一点。

604
00:27:28.690 --> 00:27:29.830
You met in the middle.
你们取了个中间值。

605
00:27:30.050 --> 00:27:34.670
Well, I want to point out two things at six minutes, five seconds during this whole conversation
好吧，我想指出在六分零五秒时，在整段对话中

